1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,863
On a lighthouse, someone was expected to stay with the light.

2
00:00:04,144 --> 00:00:09,499
But in December 1900, all three keepers of Eilean Mòr left the station at once.

3
00:00:09,779 --> 00:00:11,324
The doors were closed.

4
00:00:11,324 --> 00:00:12,517
The fire was out.

5
00:00:12,517 --> 00:00:14,131
Nobody was left inside.

6
00:00:14,413 --> 00:00:19,362
The investigator found storm damage high above the sea, at the west landing.

7
00:00:19,643 --> 00:00:23,047
Did one man fall in, and two die trying to save him?

8
00:00:23,047 --> 00:00:25,404
Or did one huge wave take all three?

9
00:00:25,684 --> 00:00:27,324
Their bodies were never found.

10
00:00:27,324 --> 00:00:28,800
What do you think happened?
